(;FF[4]CA[UTF-8]GM[1]SZ[19]GN[Yin Hang created it in five days. Commentary: This is a question asked during training at Nie Weiping Go Dojo. I remember that I was keen on difficult problems at that time, and I felt that this question was too easy. If I wanted to Nakade, I would just go to the upper level at the first sense, which was not interesting. However, Meng Tailing believes that this question is very practical and playful. Looking back now, my pursuit of the upper level of difficulty did help my calculations a lot, but it also left me with some regrets at the lower level: there were many questions that I thought were easy and I simply ignored them at the beginning.]GC[Type: Life and Death | Level: 6D | Rating: 5.0/5 | Correct: 33% (241/722) | Desc: Yin Hang created it in five days. Commentary: This is a question asked during training at Nie Weiping Go Dojo. I remember that I was keen on difficult problems at that time, and I felt that this question was too easy. If I wanted to Nakade, I would just go to the upper level at the first sense, which was not interesting. However, Meng Tailing believes that this question is very practical and playful. Looking back now, my pursuit of the upper level of difficulty did help my calculations a lot, but it also left me with some regrets at the lower level: there were many questions that I thought were easy and I simply ignored them at the beginning. | First move: White]AB[nc]AB[pc]AB[md]AB[qd]AW[jc]AW[lc]AW[ld]AW[od]AW[me]AW[pe]AW[qe]AW[qg]AW[qh]AW[qi](;W[pb](;B[oc];W[rc](;B[rd];W[qc];B[sb](;W[rb];B[ra];W[qb]C[RIGHT])(;W[ra](;B[ob];W[pd]C[RIGHT])(;B[pd];W[sc]C[RIGHT]))(;W[pd];B[qb];W[rb];B[ra];W[qa];B[sc];W[sa]C[WRONG])(;W[sc];B[ob];W[pd];B[qb];W[rb];B[pa];W[mb];B[ra];W[sa]C[WRONG]))(;B[qb];W[rb](;B[qc];W[rd];B[mb];W[qa]C[RIGHT])(;B[pa];W[qc];B[ra];W[pd];B[mb];W[ob]C[RIGHT])))(;B[qb];W[ob];B[oc];W[nb];B[mb];W[mc];B[pa](;W[lb];B[re];W[rc];B[rd];W[rb](;B[ra];W[sb];B[rf];W[qc];B[pd];W[ma]C[RIGHT])(;B[qc];W[rf];B[sb];W[ra];B[